  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Emergency Response and Recovery Partner Engagement: Expanding Efforts and Strategies to Improve Rapid Response to Public Health Emergencies Globally CDC-RFA-GH23-0042</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM works with Member States, partners and communities to mitigate the effects of outbreaks, public health emergencies and crises, building on its expertise in public health and humanitarian emergencies. IOM contributes to the development and strengthening of preparedness and response capacities, supporting implementation of the 2005 International Health Regulations and advancing the global health security, with a focus on mobility corridors, borders, border communities and in migrant-dense areas.</narrative>
  </description>
